{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"f79c5d52980c74d703e3cf78b481df77f78446d4a562beb225ed785ebfbfc222","digest":{"component_or_area":"CLI initialization / store mounting","key_entities":["rebar verify-commit-ticket","ensure_initialized","_cli/__init__.py:438","_create_tracker","REBAR_TRACKER_DIR","pure intercept","reads.ensure_fresh","init_only","dispatch-arm"],"problem_keywords":["CLI store mount","centralized initialization","pure intercepts","ticket store","verify-commit-ticket","worktree"],"propositions":["Pure intercepts like verify-commit-ticket skip the centralized store mount and fail with 'ticket store not found' in fresh linked worktrees because mount logic is replicated per dispatch-arm and not invoked before intercept dispatch.","Store mounting must be moved to a single central CLI gate that runs before both pure intercepts and set-based dispatch to guarantee all store-touching commands execute the mount step.","Commands with policy=none (init, scratch, explain, pure no-store reads) must not be force-mounted at the central gate and must continue functioning without a mounted store.","The REBAR_TRACKER_DIR environment variable override must short-circuit the central mount gate to preserve existing test and embedding behavior."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787343927422191206,"uuid":"bd674891-e5aa-460c-bd8d-86151054adf3"}